      "lines": [
        "92$^{*}$. 三角函数的积化为三角函数的和"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在证明三角恒等式、解方程、化简式子以及求原函数（参",
        "看第98小节）时，把给定的三角函数的积写成三角函数的和",
        "的形式，通常是有益的。对于三角函数的积化为三角函数的",
        "和的公式，可由加法公式（和角与差角的余弦与正弦）得出（参",
        "看第71小节）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们写出角$\\alpha$与$\\beta$的和的正弦以及差的正弦：",
        "$\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\beta\\cos\\alpha$， (1)",
        "$\\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta-\\sin\\beta\\cos\\alpha$。 (2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把等式(1)与(2)两边分别相加并用2除所得等式的两边，得",
        "出公式：",
        "$\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta=\\frac{1}{2}[\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)+\\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)]$。 (3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1 把积$\\sin75^\\circ\\cos15^\\circ$写成三角函数的和的形式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据(3)式得：",
        "$\\sin75^\\circ\\cos15^\\circ=\\frac{1}{2}[\\sin(75^\\circ+15^\\circ)+\\sin(75^\\circ-15^\\circ)]↵=\\frac{1}{2}(\\sin90^\\circ+\\sin60^\\circ)↵=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)=\\frac{2+\\sqrt{3}}{4}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们写出角$\\alpha$与$\\beta$的和的余弦以及差的余弦：",
        "$\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta-\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$， (4)",
        "$\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$。 (5)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把等式(4)与(5)两边分别相加并用2除所得等式，得出"
      ]
    },
